\"lightgray\"><mo>∗</mo></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"lightgray\"><mo>∗</mo></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>×</mo></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nSo, statement II is false. </li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\".</p>\n</div></div>",
